# Per-feed health tracking for the RSS health monitor (tools/check_feeds.py).
# Updated every cron run; not version-controlled.
.feed_health.json
# Per-edition OG social card images (tools/make_og_image.py). ~30KB each, but
# they are TRACKED, not ignored: every post's front matter carries an
# `image:` path and jekyll-seo-tag publishes it as og:image, so an uncommitted
# image means every social card / link preview points at a 404. Audio is
# tracked for the same reason. (They were gitignored until 2026-09-13, which
# 404'd the OG image for all 84 published editions.)

# Retired: heartbeat-sourced story-lead files. The moltbook/1f916 heartbeats
# capture to ~/idea-board/ instead and must not write into this repo.
/IDEAS_FROM_*.md
